# Frequently Asked Questions

### What is Rocci?
Rocci is a set of focused tools for building interfaces and technical documents with the Roc programming language.

### How does Rocdown differ from standard Markdown?
Rocdown is Markdown with explicit, compiler-checked structural declarations (`@page`, `@docs`, `@component`).

### Where should I start?
Read the [overview](/docs/getting-started/overview/) and follow the [installation guide](/docs/getting-started/installation/).
